# Map indexed assignment inserts and replaces values

Verifies that indexed assignment inserts a new key, replaces an existing key,
and keeps the original key position when it replaces a value.

>>> source
let values = {
    "first": 1,
    "second": 2
}

values["second"] = 20
values["third"] = 3
print(values)

<<< stdout
{
    "first": 1,
    "second": 20,
    "third": 3
}

<<< stderr
